  "problem": "|  | $✠$ | $♣$ | $♠$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $✠$ | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ |\n| $♣$ | $1$ | $1$ | $0$ |\n| $♠$ | $0$ | $1$ | $1$ |\n\nThe adjacency matrix of the relation $R,$ defined on the set ${✠,♣,♠},$ is given above. Which of the following ordered pairs belong to the relation?\n\n- $(✠,♣)$\n- $(♣,♠)$\n- $(♠,✠)$",
